[[build-lifecycle]]
=== Process lifecycle

**STUB**: Specifies the life of a program's processes. Covers nexus startup,
how pools are spawned and when each is considered ready, and the handshake
between them. Covers orderly shutdown, signal handling, and what happens when
the parent dies on any platform. Defines how temporary files and shared memory
are cleaned up on every exit path, and the exit codes a program can return with
their meanings.

